2F%20The%20bounded%20draft%20recognizes%20unsuffixed%20literal%20tokens.%20Rust%20token%20syntax%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20permits%20identifier%20suffixes%20even%20on%20chars%2Fbytes%3B%20those%20are%20NOT%20declared%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20malformed.%20Current%20source%20identifiers%20are%20ASCII%2C%20so%20known%20ASCII%20starts%20and%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20any%20unproved%20non-ASCII%20suffix-looking%20continuation%20refuse%20explicitly.%0A%20%20const%20following%20%3D%20units%5Bend%5D%20%3F%3F%20-1%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28acceptRustSourceHeaderLifetimeCharacter%28following%2C%20true%29%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20return%20%7B%20%24%3A%20%27unsupportedSuffix%27%2C%20at%3A%20end%2C%20end%3A%20end%20%2B%201%20%7D%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20if%20%28following%20%3E%3D%20128%20%26%26%20%21acceptRustSourceWhitespace%28following%29%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20scalar%20%3D%20readSourceTextScalar%28units%2C%20end%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28scalar%20%3C%200%29%20return%20%7B%20%24%3A%20%27nonScalar%27%2C%20at%3A%20end%2C%20end%3A%20end%20%2B%201%20%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20return%20%7B%20%24%3A%20%27unsupportedSuffix%27%2C%20at%3A%20end%2C%20end%3A%20end%20%2B%20%28scalar%20%3E%3D%2065536%20%3F%202%20%3A%201%29%20%7D%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20if%20%28byte%29%20return%20%7B%20%24%3A%20%27byteChar%27%2C%20value%2C%20contentStart%2C%20contentEnd%2C%20end%20%7D%3B%0A%20%20return%20%7B%20%24%3A%20%27char%27%2C%20value%2C%20contentStart%2C%20contentEnd%2C%20end%20%7D%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%0A%20%2A%20Read%20one%20unsuffixed%20character%2Fbyte-character%20token%20at%20its%20absolute%20start.%0A%20%2A%20A%20plain%20apostrophe%20without%20exactly%20one%20scalar%20and%20a%20closing%20apostrophe%0A%20%2A%20returns%20notCharacter%2C%20preserving%20the%20existing%20lifetime%2Flabel%20token%20path.%0A%20%2A%20It%20does%20not%20authenticate%20that%20the%20remaining%20source%20is%20a%20valid%20lifetime.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20units%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%7D%20start%20%40returns%20%7BRustCharacterLiteral%7D%0A